0 BEGIN PGM VC MM
1 ; WRITTEN FOR GEDIT - SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM, NOT FOR A MACHINE
2 ; A CUTTING SPEED WRITTEN AS VC: IS SCALED, THE FORM STAYS
3 FUNCTION MODE TURN
4 TOOL CALL 12
5 FUNCTION TURNDATA SPIN VCONST:ON VC:120 SMAX3000
6 L X+40 Z+2 R0 FMAX M303
7 FUNCTION TURNDATA SPIN VCONST:OFF S1500
8 TOOL CALL 14
9 FUNCTION TURNDATA SPIN VCONST:ON VC:95.5 SMAX2500 ; VC:300 IN A COMMENT
10 FUNCTION MODE MILL
11 END PGM VC MM
